e ticket runs/rNN_<author><year>_<paper>.sh; its Result is the folder results/rNN_<...>/ with the same name.", "originalText": "Each row reads one Result card (title, cite, subject, venue, verification) and its runtime.yaml receipt. A paper marked NEEDS-VERIFICATION shows first on Check › Citations.\nA Run is the ticket runs/rNN_<author><year>_<paper>.sh; its Result is the folder results/rNN_<...>/ with the same name.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 8, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_runs", "type": "rectangle", "x": 5280.0, "y": 1862.5, "width": 2140.0, "height": 960.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-workbench", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1505377913, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 509185054, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791141824381, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "kept_runs-title", "type": "text", "x": 5305.0, "y": 1887.5, "width": 107.80000000000001, "height": 34.375, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-workbench", "roundness": null, "seed": 662021992, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2040570649, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791141824381, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Runs  ◂", "originalText": "Runs  ◂", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 8, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_runs-type0", "type": "rectangle", "x": 5305.0, "y": 1950.0, "width": 325.0, "height": 50.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roug