l, "seed": 559818483, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 655774951, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791141824381, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Runs of the picked row\nread r01_chen2021   done   ⧉\nread r03_lee2022   blocked ⧉", "originalText": "Runs of the picked row\nread r01_chen2021   done   ⧉\nread r03_lee2022   blocked ⧉", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_runs-note", "type": "text", "x": 5675.0, "y": 2312.5, "width": 372.40000000000003, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-workbench", "roundness": null, "seed": 913026584, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 614680269, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791141824381, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Status lives here, never in the table.\nPicking a paper row narrows the list.\nCopy hands the prompt to a session;\nnothing here starts a run.", "originalText": "Status lives here, never in the table.\nPicking a paper row narrows the list.\nCopy hands the prompt to a session;\nnothing here starts a run.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 8, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_ws-notes", "type": "text", "x": 1480.0, "y": 2780.0, "width": 2553.6000000000004, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-workbench", "roundness": null, "seed": 199678071, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1019347239, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791141824381, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A row is one Paper Run. Tasks list each Task Page and its synthesis; Questions are Logic │ Work │ Report rows whose Work cites Runs. A Result card, a Task page, a report and a drawing open in one pop-out. No status in the table.", "originalText": "A row is one Paper Run. Tasks list each Task Page and its synthesis; Questions are Logic │ Work │ Report rows whose Work cites Runs. A Result card, a Task page, a report and a drawing open in one pop-out. No status in the table.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 8, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_p3-title", "type": "text", "x": 1450.0, "y": 3017.5, "width": 764.4000000000001, "height": 43.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-folders", "roundness": null, "seed": 1033243451, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1488001700, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791141824381, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 · Where things live: the Block folder", "originalText": "3 · Where things live: the Block folder", "fontSize": 35, "fontFamily": 8, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_tree-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1450.0, "y": 3087.5, "width": 6000.0, "height": 550.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-folders", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 423569543, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 601790483, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791141824381, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "kept_tree", "type": "text", "x": 1490.0, "y": 3122.5, "width": 1485.0, "height": 375.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame-folders", "roundness": null, "seed": 1378080462, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 791715868, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791141824381, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "discoveries/bNN_<block>/\n├── board.md                          header · text · Questions register · Related resources\n├── jNN_<job>/                         one inquiry\n│   └── tNN_<task>/                    one Task Page: tNN_<task>.md · discovery.yaml\n│       ├── runs/rNN_<author><year>_<paper>.sh      one ticket for each paper\n│       ├── results/rNN_<author><year>_<paper>/     card · facts.md · runtime.yaml · one-entry .bib\n│       └── summary.md · verdict.md · landscape.md  the Task's synthesis, one of the three\n├── studio/                            drawings (generated ones by studio/_build/)\n├── reports/qNN_<topic>/               one report Page per Question\n│   ├── qNN_<topic>.md · page.toml\n│   └── runs/                          the Page's own runs (check)\n└── _old/                              replaced material; do not use", "originalText": "discoveries/bNN_<block>/\n├── board.md                          header · text · Questions register · Related resources\n├── jNN_<job>/                         one inquiry\n│   └── tNN_<task>/                    one Task Page: tNN_<task>.md · discovery.yaml\n│       ├── runs/rNN_<author><year>_<paper>.sh      one ticket for each paper\n│       ├── results/rNN_<author><year>_<paper>/     card · facts.md · runtime.yaml · one-entry .bib\n│       └── summary.md · verdict.md · landscape.md  the Task's synthesis, one of the three\n├── studio/                            drawings (generated ones by studio/_build/)\n├── reports/qNN_<topic>/               one report Page per Question\n│   ├── qNN_<topic>.md · page.toml\n│   └── runs/                          the Page's own runs (check)\n└─